  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [webpack-dev-middleware](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware) from `v2.0.1` to `v2.0.6`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v2.0.2`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/releases/v2.0.2)\n\n#### Updates\n\n- Implemented [`webpack-log`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/webpack-log), removed dependencies related to the previous logging implementation.\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v2.0.2\n-   [`c25b883`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/c25b88370691c76b5659b26e7c60b181e1ded1af) (sp) Update Readme (#&#8203;237)\n-   [`0f9e063`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/0f9e0635863add14db27fa7ab0392ec4d4b2a8ab) fixed name of logging lib and added link (#&#8203;238)\n-   [`314216b`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/314216bef640b28872fc9c94e1386ed2cace96c6) implementing webpack-log, cleaning up sinon sandboxes in tests\n-   [`97a3c0f`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/97a3c0f87fb9bd69cef3692ebffe7f51d4f7dcc5) 2.0.2\n#### v2.0.3\n-   [`ef277fb`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/ef277fbed2ea4333abd4cb4717b2b7f5c298e30e) removing custom wasm mime type after mime@&#8203;2.1.0 update\n-   [`4edbc72`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/4edbc72992ee6cde477c38aadab249ed287ef082) 2.0.3\n#### v2.0.4\n-   [`9915be7`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/9915be7d2fb56a6be389b740aeef5936ea1c48b5) Edit markdown grammar in README.md (#&#8203;243)\n-   [`3825e42`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/3825e4264170e0af2a790b3b95994363bb284006) Fixes typo in readme (#&#8203;240)\n-   [`19deafa`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/19deafad5f6565a9253f10f41dce7ef75d1d4275) fixing format of watchOptions default value\n-   [`368e185`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/368e185b44f577e6ccd7065c7a58d76c88e54501) adding colors to default stats options\n-   [`bb57ce6`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/bb57ce6dd966a3a8f910da06d281c123df184634) 2.0.4\n#### v2.0.5\n-   [`236afb1`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/236afb1c28e443e4fd9cddff9973e8edfe9e5f0b) docs(README): Fix links to source and describe webpack-log (#&#8203;248)\n-   [`2e772c1`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/2e772c14c97eb6d9c51acaf62df79ce7c51168ce) fixes #&#8203;252: missing contributing.md\n-   [`f17765f`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/f17765fb440793baaeb370dd7d1a128e361e43a4) Allow webpack v4 and v4-beta (#&#8203;251)\n-   [`ba6248f`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/ba6248fb92ffd80d8b5a6e23659c0de3b5391af7) prevent multiple identical compilations via watch startTime (#&#8203;250)\n-   [`fed8046`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/fed8046b706fbb4714df1efb76bc5fb761c9a79b) Update README.md (#&#8203;256)\n-   [`6489fa1`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/6489fa10c0fa5902c111f6942101d77a9bbfd6d9) Fix getPaths for publicPaths that are URLs (#&#8203;255) (#&#8203;257)\n-   [`0f9ccbe`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/0f9ccbe9ddf1e359c7b92f071fc4d811f83f1b7c) 2.0.5\n#### v2.0.6\n-   [`c06df6f`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/c06df6f8494a1083846c74f37fa68416640052be) fixes #&#8203;258: skip compilers with no publicPath (#&#8203;259)\n-   [`2589b7b`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/2589b7b0b937d2753930e0a29ffac60eff452c0f) Fix a repeated typo in README.md (#&#8203;261)\n-   [`0d57c32`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-middleware/commit/0d57c32aab3d238b0e5e18e9539934e7d31ba821) 2.0.6\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
